Scope and third-party notice

This license covers the text, the route catalog, the scripts, the short
presentation deck (apresentacao/) and the MCP server code (mcp/) written for
this repository. The test fixtures (mcp/test/fixtures/) are recorded
responses of a Hacash node to public read-only queries of the public chain;
they are factual output, not creative work, and are published as such. It does not cover Hacash code, which belongs to its authors.

Licenses of the Hacash repositories, as checked on 2026-10-21
(`gh api orgs/hacash/repos` and the root of each repository):

- 14 of 33 are MIT: x16rs-sys, node, miner, core, service, mint, rust, jssdk,
  cmdwallet, channelpay, rustHacash, chain, HVM,
  PaymentChannelChainNetServiceNodeRoutes.
- 19 of 33 have no license file and no license metadata: fullnode, explorer,
  hascan, fullnodedev, fullnodetest, doc, doc-chinese, www, wallet, dao,
  explorer1, www1, wallet1, paper, x16rs, pcwallet, blockmint, bitcoin,
  web_base_framework. Without a written license, the default is "all rights
  reserved". Ask the maintainers before reusing their code or text.

This repository copies no code from those repositories. It cites paths and
line numbers and describes the shape of the node's responses.
